{title: 029 - Sing Praise to God}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #029 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: D}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 29}
{meta: category Worship - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[D]Sing praise [A7/E]to [F#m]God [D/F#]who [A7/G]reigns [Bm]above,
[Bm]the God [Em]of [F#m]all [A]creation,
[A]the [D]God of power, [F#m]the [D/F#]God [A7/G]of [Bm]love,
[Bm]the God [Em]of [F#m]our salvation.
[Bm]With [F#m/C#]healing balm [Bm]my [A/C#]soul [Em]He [A7]fills,
[A7]and every [D]faithless [Bm]murmur [A]stills;
[D/F#]To [G]God [Em]all [A]praise [F#m]and [Em]glory!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[D]What God's almighty power [Bm]hath [D]made
[Bm]His gracious [F#m]mercy keepeth;
[A]By [D]morning glow [A7/E]or [F#m]evening [Bm]shade,
[Bm]His watchful [F#m]eye ne'er [Em]sleepeth,
[Bm]Within [C#7]the [F#m]kingdom [A/C#]of [Em]his [A7]might,
[A7]Lo! [D/F#]all [Em]is [D]just, and [Bm]all [E7]is [A]right:
[D/F#]To [G]God [Em]all [A]praise [F#m]and [Em]glory!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[D]The Lord [A7/E]is [F#m]never [A7/G]far [Bm]away,
[Bm]throughout [Em]all [F#m]grief [A]distressing,
[A]an [D]ever present help [A7/G]and [Bm]stay,
[Bm]our peace [Em]and [F#m]joy and [Em]blessing.
[Bm]As [F#m/C#]with [C#7]a [F#m]mother's [A/C#]tender [A7]hand,
[A7]He [D/F#]leads [Em]His [D]own, His [Bm]chosen [A]band:
[D/F#]To [G]God [Em]all [A]praise [F#m]and [Em]glory!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[D]Then all [A7/E]my [F#m]gladsome [A7/G]way [Bm]along,
[Bm]I sing [Em]aloud [A]thy [F#m]praises,
[A]that [D]men may hear [A7/E]the [F#m]grateful [Bm]song
[Bm]my voice [F#m]unwearied [Em]raises:
[Bm]Be [F#m/C#]joyful in [Bm]the [A/C#]Lord, [Em]my [A7]heart!
[A7]both [D/F#]soul [Em]and [D]body [Bm]bear [E7]your [A]part!
[D/F#]To [G]God [Em]all [A]praise [F#m]and [Em]glory.
{end_of_verse}
